OL,3,GNEWSAFears for protected bats if
OL,4,Aglamping pod plans are approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FFears have been raised over plans for a
OL,7,Fglamping site in a woodland with
OL,8,Fmultiple species of bat.
OL,10,FGwynedd council was considering the
OL,11,Fapplication for 11 pods at Bluebell
OL,12,FWoods, Caerhun, which would also
OL,13,Finclude pathways, a parking area, soft
OL,14,Flandscaping and drainage.
OL,16,FA bat survey commissioned before the
OL,17,Fproposed work concluded that without a
OL,18,Fmitigation strategy the impact on the
OL,19,Fcreatures would be "major" and restrict
OL,20,Fmany of "the most light-sensitive
OL,21,Fspecies" from continuing to use the
OL,22,Flocation.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
